+/* ==========================================================================
+   Score Breakdown ("Why this score?") — scoped styles
+   All selectors are prefixed with .sb- so nothing else on the page is affected.
+   Uses the design tokens already defined in styles/dashboard.css.
+   ========================================================================== */
